  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A <math><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> long perfectly conducting wire <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi></math> is moving, with a velocity <math><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></mrow></math> on a pair of horizontal rails of zero resistance. One side of the rails is connected to an inductor <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></math> and a resistance <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></math> as shown in figure. The horizontal rails, <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></math> and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></math> lie in the same plane with a uniform magnetic field <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></math> perpendicular to the plane. If the key <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></math> is closed at certain instant, the current in the circuit after <math><mn>1</mn></math> milli second is <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>,</mo></math> where the value of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math> is_______.<br/>[Assume the velocity of wire <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi></math> remains constant <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></math> after key <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></math> is closed. Given: <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0.37</mn><mo>,</mo></math> where <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></math> is base of the natural logarithm]<br ><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/0edc553a-0712-47fa-948f-5f69477b0954-image26.png\"/></p>",
    "image": null
